AB  - Tuesday, 28 July 2026 Multiple prize wins for Faculty members News Faculty researchers and students have received national and international recognition for their outstanding scholarship, with a series of prestigious prizes and commendations celebrating excellence in historical research. Wellcome Trust Postdoctoral Fellow Somak Biswas has been awarded the Modern British Studies Association's (MBSA) Early Career Prize for best paper delivered at their annual conference (June 2026, University of Birmingham). His paper 'AIDS and the Racialisation of Mobility: Britain, 1985-1995' explored the…
